  "result": "All 617 tests pass. The fix: `findIssueById` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` was querying by `eq(issues.id, issueId)` alone, ignoring the `orgId` parameter entirely — unlike every other lookup in the codebase (`findIssueByNumber`, `findCommentById`, etc.) which combine an `orgPredicate` with the id check. This let an issue ID from one organization resolve successfully even when queried with a different org's `orgId`, undermining the tenant-scope checks built on top of it. Added `orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId)` to the query's `where` clause so cross-tenant lookups correctly return `null`.",
